WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.940
I've been in this industry a long time. I've seen things. The real elite, the ones at the very top, they don't just play power games. They worship something much darker. They worship the devil. I've been to those parties. I've heard the rituals, seen the symbols. It's not metaphor. It's real. They sell their souls for fame and power.
